# =====================================================================================================================
# What must NEVER be committed: anything private to one player's PC, the game's own files, anyone's saves.
# The shipped data pack (items.json, catalog/, datapack.json) and the tool's own icon are the only game-derived/binary files that belong in git.
# =====================================================================================================================

# --- Private / personal: made on each player's computer ---
Backups/
Archive/
Releases/
icons/
icons-missing.txt
config.json
theme.json
spoiler.json
backpacks.json
backpack-tweaks.json
stack-tweaks.json
weapon-tweaks.json
teleport-spots.json
teleport-undo.json
recipe-tweaks.json
pictures.json
error.log
*.log
ForumPost.txt
release-scan.txt

# --- The game's files and anyone's saves: never ---
*.pfs
*.pfs.*
*.pak
*.utoc
*.ucas
*.uasset
*.ubulk
*.uexp
*.umap
*.usmap
Output/
Exports/

# --- Artwork: the repo ships only the tool's own icon; everything else under assets/ is local (game art, shortcut icon...) ---
assets/*
!assets/app.ico
!assets/app-icon.png

# --- Story text and internal indexes: made locally by the Build scripts, never part of the data pack ---
catalog/text.csv
catalog/lore.csv
catalog/export-index.csv
catalog/_types.json
catalog/_tops.txt
catalog/_numbers.json

# --- Downloaded / built binaries ---
oodle-data-shared.dll
*.dll
*.exe
*.zip

# --- Temp, backups, editors, OS ---
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.tmp
*.orig
~$*
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
docs/discord/
